01:32:49.837 --> 01:32:50.997
<v SPEAKER_8>Falsch, Nelkenhass?

01:32:51.017 --> 01:32:51.997
<v SPEAKER_6>Auch falsch.

01:32:52.017 --> 01:32:53.217
<v SPEAKER_9>Rosenstolz?

